{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>AlbumBee 是一款專為整理 iPhone 相片圖庫而設的工具，適合面對大量相片與影片、經常收到儲存空間不足提示的用戶。它可排序、壓縮及清理相片圖庫，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>整理相片釋放空間</h2>\n<p>AlbumBee 會將佔用空間最大的檔案排在前方，方便快速刪除並釋放數 GB 空間；同時支援 RAW+JPG 精簡、H.264 影片轉換為 HEVC、連拍歸組、螢幕截圖分類、地點地圖與時間統計等功能。所有掃描、壓縮和轉換均在 iPhone 上完成，無須登入或上傳，刪除前亦由你親自確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AlbumBee – Photo Cleanup</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T01:39:08.694124+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}